    "detailed_description": "<strong>Match the monsters in this retro style puzzler inspired by classic games.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOLVE MIND BENDING PUZZLES</h2>Play as 5 characters across 100 levels, as they delve into their dangerous dreams. Scoot monsters to match them, but be mindful as they'll move until they hit an obstacle.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY TOGETHER!</h2>Join as a ghostly apparition with emotive abilities. Will you recommend solutions, or simply laugh at your friends as they fail again and again?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNCOVER THE MYSTERY</h2>Enjoy a break from the puzzles in the story chapters, where Savannah, an amateur researcher, investigates paranormal events plaguing her small town.",
